{
    "title": "Telemundo 52: Los \u00c1ngeles",
    "description": "Telemundo 52's redesigned news and weather app connects you to the best local content, the most accurate weather forecasts, breaking news alerts, live TV, and investigative journalism.\r\n\r\nTHE AUTHORITY IN TIME FOR LOS ANGELES\r\n\r\n+ Customizable weather home screen with weather modules that you can rearrange\r\n+ Improved location center to add new locations and set weather alerts\r\n+ Exclusive real-time radar\r\n+ 10-day forecast for Los Angeles and Southern California \r\n+ Hourly forecasts with customizable graphs \r\n+ Detailed forecast information including UV index and dew point \r\n+ Weather alerts for your area\r\n+ Information about school closures due to bad weather in Los Angeles counties \r\n\r\nCALIFORNIA NEWS LIVE ALERTS AND VIDEO\r\n\r\n+ Personalized alerts for local news from Santa Monica, Anaheim, Santa Ana and news from the US-Mexico border \r\n+ Breaking news section showing articles in reverse chronological order \r\n+ Alert center showing the most important news\r\n+ Watch live Telemundo 52 newscasts and other streaming content\r\n+ Specific section of videos, all access and sports including the best content from the World Cup\r\n\r\nTELEMUNDO INVESTIGATIONS RESPONSE AND MORE \r\n\r\n+ Telemundo 52 Responde solve your problems as a consumer and fight to get your money back\r\n+ CNBC Financial News\r\n+ Local and national news from NBC Los Angeles\r\n\r\nTelemundo 52 Los Angeles' news and weather app includes proprietary Nielsen measurement software that will allow you to contribute to market research, such as Nielsen's TV Ratings. Please visit www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information. \r\n\r\nYour privacy options: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo-spanish?brandA=Owned_Stations&intake=Telemundo_52      \r\nCalifornia Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy-policy/aviso-de-california?intake=Telemundo_52 \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTelemundo 52\u2019s redesigned news and weather app connects you to the top local content, the most accurate weather forecasts, breaking news alerts, live TV, and investigative journalism. \r\n\r\n\r\nLOS ANGELES WEATHER ALERTS \r\n\r\n+ Exclusive real-time radar\r\n+ 10-day forecast for Los Angeles and Southern California \r\n+ Hourly forecasts in the morning and afternoons with customizable graphics \r\n+ Detailed weather information including UV index and dew point \r\n+ Information on school weather closings in LA counties\r\n\r\nLOS ANGELES LIVE NEWS ALERTS, TRAFFIC UPDATES AND VIDEO \r\n\r\n+ Customized alerts for local Los Angeles news and national U.S - Mexico border news including the latest on immigration \r\n+ Breaking news section showing articles in reverse chronological order \r\n+ Alert center that displays the most important news and trends you need to know about\r\n+ Watch live newscasts from Telemundo 52 Los \u00c1ngeles and other streaming content\r\n+ Specific video, entertainment and live coverage of sports, including coverage of the World Cup\r\n\r\nTELEMUNDO RESPONDS INVESTIGATIONS AND MORE \r\n\r\n+ Telemundo 52 Responde solves your consumer problems and fights to get your money back\r\n+ Business news from CNBC\r\n+ Local and national news from NBCU Local",
    "descriptionHTML": "Telemundo 52&#39;s redesigned news and weather app connects you to the best local content, the most accurate weather forecasts, breaking news alerts, live TV, and investigative journalism.<br><br>THE AUTHORITY IN TIME FOR LOS ANGELES<br><br>+ Customizable weather home screen with weather modules that you can rearrange<br>+ Improved location center to add new locations and set weather alerts<br>+ Exclusive real-time radar<br>+ 10-day forecast for Los Angeles and Southern California <br>+ Hourly forecasts with customizable graphs <br>+ Detailed forecast information including UV index and dew point <br>+ Weather alerts for your area<br>+ Information about school closures due to bad weather in Los Angeles counties <br><br>CALIFORNIA NEWS LIVE ALERTS AND VIDEO<br><br>+ Personalized alerts for local news from Santa Monica, Anaheim, Santa Ana and news from the US-Mexico border <br>+ Breaking news section showing articles in reverse chronological order <br>+ Alert center showing the most important news<br>+ Watch live Telemundo 52 newscasts and other streaming content<br>+ Specific section of videos, all access and sports including the best content from the World Cup<br><br>TELEMUNDO INVESTIGATIONS RESPONSE AND MORE <br><br>+ Telemundo 52 Responde solve your problems as a consumer and fight to get your money back<br>+ CNBC Financial News<br>+ Local and national news from NBC Los Angeles<br><br>Telemundo 52 Los Angeles&#39; news and weather app includes proprietary Nielsen measurement software that will allow you to contribute to market research, such as Nielsen&#39;s TV Ratings. Please visit www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information. <br><br>Your privacy options: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo-spanish?brandA=Owned_Stations&amp;intake=Telemundo_52      <br>California Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy-policy/aviso-de-california?intake=Telemundo_52 <br><br><br><br>Telemundo 52\u2019s redesigned news and weather app connects you to the top local content, the most accurate weather forecasts, breaking news alerts, live TV, and investigative journalism. <br><br><br>LOS ANGELES WEATHER ALERTS <br><br>+ Exclusive real-time radar<br>+ 10-day forecast for Los Angeles and Southern California <br>+ Hourly forecasts in the morning and afternoons with customizable graphics <br>+ Detailed weather information including UV index and dew point <br>+ Information on school weather closings in LA counties<br><br>LOS ANGELES LIVE NEWS ALERTS, TRAFFIC UPDATES AND VIDEO <br><br>+ Customized alerts for local Los Angeles news and national U.S - Mexico border news including the latest on immigration <br>+ Breaking news section showing articles in reverse chronological order <br>+ Alert center that displays the most important news and trends you need to know about<br>+ Watch live newscasts from Telemundo 52 Los \u00c1ngeles and other streaming content<br>+ Specific video, entertainment and live coverage of sports, including coverage of the World Cup<br><br>TELEMUNDO RESPONDS INVESTIGATIONS AND MORE <br><br>+ Telemundo 52 Responde solves your consumer problems and fights to get your money back<br>+ Business news from CNBC<br>+ Local and national news from NBCU Local",
